 "<color=white>PURPOSE:</color> Reduce enemy Influence in a country.": "<color=white>目的：</color>削减敌方在某国的影响力。",
 "<color=white>CONDITIONS:</color> Opponent must have Influence markers in the target country.": "<color=white>条件：</color>对手必须在目标国家有影响力标记。",
 "<color=white>COST:</color> 1 card.": "<color=white>花费：</color>1 张牌。",
 "<color=white>PROCEDURE:</color> Each player rolls a die and each player adds the modifiers (listed below) to their own die roll.  The high roller may remove the difference between the rolls from the opponent's Influence in the target country.  Ties are considered a draw, and no markers are removed.  A player may make several realignment attempts against the same country using the Operations points from the same card.": "<color=white>流程：</color>双方各掷一颗骰子，并各自把下列修正加到自己的点数上。点数高的一方可从目标国家移除对手的影响力，数量等于双方点数之差。点数相同视为平局，不移除任何标记。玩家可以用同一张牌的行动点，对同一个国家进行多次重组尝试。",
 "<color=white>MODIFIERS:</color>\n+1 for each controlled adjacent country\n+1 if adjacent to rolling player's superpower\n+1 if rolling player has more influence in target country than opponent": "<color=white>修正：</color>\n+1 每有一个己方控制的相邻国家\n+1 若目标国家与掷骰方的超级大国相邻\n+1 若掷骰方在目标国家的影响力多于对手",
 "<color=white>MODIFIERS:</color><br>+1 for each controlled adjacent country<br>+1 if adjacent to rolling player's superpower<br>+1 if rolling player has more influence in target country than opponent": "<color=white>修正：</color><br>+1 每有一个己方控制的相邻国家<br>+1 若目标国家与掷骰方的超级大国相邻<br>+1 若掷骰方在目标国家的影响力多于对手",
